# One project per line: just the path. Each becomes an inner tmux session named
# after the directory, holding one shell in the checkout. What else it holds is
# the project's own business: give it a `.mullion/project.sh` with a `layout`
# phase and lay the panes out there. See the README.
#
# Only main checkouts go here. Task worktrees are made with M-n, appear under
# their project in the sidebar, and take their panes from the same script's
# `layout-task` phase, or from mn's default when it has none.
#
~/projects/api
~/projects/frontend
